WEBVTT

00:00:00.460 --> 00:00:06.650
It may be a faint dream, but let me see it
Hakanaki yume saredo yume misete

00:00:10.910 --> 00:00:16.190
I'm in a complete daze under the sun
Konmei ryouran ni under the sun wow wow

00:00:16.190 --> 00:00:20.920
Guided only by my flowering love for you
Konmei ryouran ni do ai do wow wow

00:00:21.330 --> 00:00:23.530
Let the flower of life bloom
Hirakeyo inochi no hana

00:00:23.530 --> 00:00:26.390
Let it follow its red hot desires
Akaku atsuku midasarete

00:00:26.390 --> 00:00:28.550
This flame runs through the pulses
Fujouri na mirai no kodou

00:00:28.550 --> 00:00:31.350
Of the absurd future
Kakenukeru honoo

00:00:31.350 --> 00:00:36.450
I feel so guilty for devoting myself to earning your love
Aisaretakute kono mi sasageru tsumibukasa ga

00:00:36.450 --> 00:00:40.570
I feel it tingling inside me
Watashi no naka de jirijiri shiteru ne

00:00:40.570 --> 00:00:42.070
Desire
Yokubou

00:00:42.070 --> 00:00:45.780
A bolt of lightning that brings about tomorrow
Sore wa ashita wo maneku inazuma

00:00:45.780 --> 00:00:50.700
And turns into great pleasure
Yagate tsuyoi yorokobi ni naru

00:00:50.700 --> 00:00:56.540
I'm sure you don't know yet
Mada shiranai hazu anata wa kitto

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:03.300
It's cruel when you can't even have a faint dream
Hakanaki yume saredo yume minu hibi wa mugoi yo

00:01:03.300 --> 00:01:08.260
I want to hold on to these newborn desires
Umaretate no negai wo tada dakishimete itai

00:01:08.260 --> 00:01:11.560
More wild than soft
Yasashii yori mo hageshiku ne

00:01:11.560 --> 00:01:14.730
That will make my day
Sore de ima ga michite kuru sa

00:01:14.730 --> 00:01:21.270
Who is going to protect this world (this dangerous world)
Michibikarete tashikameru sekai wa (ayaui sekai wa)

00:01:21.270 --> 00:01:23.190
That I can only see for myself?
Dare ga mamoru

00:01:23.190 --> 00:01:29.700
I can do it, so love me truly
Mamoreru dakara honki de ai shiteyo

00:01:30.300 --> 00:01:31.500
<b>Dark Samurai</b>

00:01:42.970 --> 00:01:44.210
There!

00:01:56.400 --> 00:01:57.770
Who are you?

00:01:59.770 --> 00:02:04.400
I don't have a name to give to filth like you.

00:02:05.790 --> 00:02:09.320
So... your grave is nameless?

00:02:15.330 --> 00:02:16.790
I win!

00:02:25.790 --> 00:02:29.340
I guess I win this one too.

00:02:34.100 --> 00:02:38.600
If you're a samurai, why don't you fight properly?

00:02:39.080 --> 00:02:42.480
Who said I came here to fight?

00:02:43.840 --> 00:02:44.980
I see.

00:02:46.190 --> 00:02:47.860
Oh, not bad!

00:02:50.660 --> 00:02:52.840
But I still win!

00:02:59.260 --> 00:03:00.250
I guess this one's a tie.

00:03:05.950 --> 00:03:08.710
You bitch! Do you have some kind of tit fetish?

00:03:09.300 --> 00:03:11.480
I'm a woman! Of course it's on my mind.

00:03:12.130 --> 00:03:13.720
The size of my boobs, that is!

00:03:14.420 --> 00:03:16.560
And only boobs?

00:03:19.460 --> 00:03:22.350
I suppose that's enough fooling around.

00:03:24.300 --> 00:03:25.270
Yeah.

00:03:25.270 --> 00:03:27.650
You ain't leaving here alive.

00:03:34.730 --> 00:03:37.020
See you later, flatties!

00:03:38.300 --> 00:03:40.710
Those tricks won't work against me!

00:03:40.710 --> 00:03:43.370
Who said it's a trick?

00:03:44.260 --> 00:03:45.200
What?

00:03:53.970 --> 00:03:56.490
I didn't know there was a warrior like that out there.

00:03:57.100 --> 00:03:58.510
Very interesting!

00:04:05.150 --> 00:04:07.100
Phew.

00:04:07.100 --> 00:04:10.350
If they'd decided to go all out a bit sooner,

00:04:10.350 --> 00:04:11.740
I'd be headless by now.

00:04:21.960 --> 00:04:24.330
Now the dojo can return to its original glory.

00:04:24.330 --> 00:04:27.580
H-Hey, how do you explain this?!

00:04:28.460 --> 00:04:29.630
Explain what?

00:04:29.970 --> 00:04:31.680
<i>This</i> right here!

00:04:31.680 --> 00:04:33.880
No one told me we were closing!

00:04:33.880 --> 00:04:36.760
But we all discussed it last night.

00:04:37.970 --> 00:04:39.280
How is it, Yukimura?

00:04:39.280 --> 00:04:40.720
Yeah, I think this will do.

00:04:42.480 --> 00:04:43.570
Yeah!

00:04:43.570 --> 00:04:46.110
With this, we've paid back all our debts!

00:04:47.370 --> 00:04:50.810
The prize money for getting first place in the M-1 really helped a ton.

00:04:50.810 --> 00:04:51.890
Yes.

00:04:51.890 --> 00:04:55.450
And it's all thanks to your devious tricks backstage, milady!

00:04:55.900 --> 00:04:58.080
So, about the cafe...

00:04:58.080 --> 00:05:00.520
We don't have to keep it going anymore.

00:05:00.520 --> 00:05:04.460
Its entire purpose was to repay the dojo's debts.

00:05:06.500 --> 00:05:09.940
The deadline those four set for us is approaching quickly too.

00:05:09.940 --> 00:05:12.550
We don't have the time to run a maid cafe.

00:05:12.900 --> 00:05:15.650
Yeah! We've gotta train hard together!

00:05:16.600 --> 00:05:20.030
So as of today, True Shadow is closed!

00:05:20.030 --> 00:05:21.040
Yep!

00:05:21.680 --> 00:05:23.610
Remember?

00:05:23.610 --> 00:05:25.310
But you were there too, Kanestugu.

00:05:26.600 --> 00:05:29.490
I-I cannot accept this!

00:05:29.490 --> 00:05:31.650
No one asked for my opinion!

00:05:31.650 --> 00:05:35.740
We also agreed to start our qi training today.

00:05:35.740 --> 00:05:39.320
Qi training? What the hell is that?

00:05:39.320 --> 00:05:44.540
Well, we watched the videos Matabei-san took during the M-1.

00:05:45.480 --> 00:05:47.620
Look at the videos of those four.

00:05:48.170 --> 00:05:50.380
After applying a certain filter...

00:05:51.350 --> 00:05:52.830
What's this?

00:05:52.830 --> 00:05:54.170
The other three are the same.

00:06:02.820 --> 00:06:05.220
That might be qi.

00:06:05.700 --> 00:06:06.730
Qi?

00:06:07.240 --> 00:06:10.060
I heard about it during my training pilgrimage.

00:06:11.560 --> 00:06:16.750
Apparently, it's some kind of energy that can be found anywhere in nature.

00:06:16.750 --> 00:06:20.650
Masters of martial arts can learn to control it as they wish.

00:06:20.650 --> 00:06:22.580
They can even use it to defeat their opponents.

00:06:23.220 --> 00:06:27.080
So those four are using this "qi" thing?

00:06:27.080 --> 00:06:30.080
It's not that far-fetched.

00:06:30.080 --> 00:06:34.430
I was wondering why were they so strong.

00:06:34.430 --> 00:06:38.320
If they <i>are</i> qi users, then it all makes sense.

00:06:38.320 --> 00:06:39.440
That's true.

00:06:39.440 --> 00:06:43.050
Also, please look at this.

00:06:43.760 --> 00:06:46.030
What happened to Juubei?

00:06:46.030 --> 00:06:46.720
This is...

00:06:47.770 --> 00:06:49.140
Juubei used qi as well?

00:06:49.700 --> 00:06:52.060
I didn't do anything.

00:06:52.580 --> 00:06:54.920
So she tapped into it subconsciously?

00:06:54.920 --> 00:06:56.970
Now it makes sense.

00:06:56.970 --> 00:07:00.140
This explains why they just left during the M-1 finals.

00:07:00.140 --> 00:07:03.680
They sensed something when they saw Juubei using qi?

00:07:03.680 --> 00:07:04.810
Probably.

00:07:05.390 --> 00:07:06.540
Qi, huh?

00:07:08.330 --> 00:07:13.880
If we want a fighting chance against them, won't we need to master qi as well?

00:07:14.220 --> 00:07:16.420
Well, that's obvious!

00:07:16.420 --> 00:07:20.680
The problem is <i>how</i> do we master it?

00:07:23.390 --> 00:07:28.670
I heard rumors of a qi master in Yonezawa, so I paid her a visit.

00:07:28.670 --> 00:07:30.720
I wasn't able to meet her, though.

00:07:30.720 --> 00:07:33.270
I think her name was Maeda Keishi.

00:07:33.270 --> 00:07:37.210
A Maeda from Yonezawa? That rings a bell.

00:07:37.210 --> 00:07:41.880
I recall someone like that studying in the Buou Academy's Yonezawa branch.

00:07:41.880 --> 00:07:43.970
Hanzou! Bring the student list!

00:07:43.970 --> 00:07:44.780
Yes!

00:07:45.320 --> 00:07:47.740
Yeah, I think this is her.

00:07:47.740 --> 00:07:49.480
This is Maeda Keiji?

00:07:49.480 --> 00:07:51.100
She has a wandering nature.

00:07:51.100 --> 00:07:52.650
She's accomplished at disguising herself.

00:07:52.650 --> 00:07:53.680
She hates men?

00:07:54.150 --> 00:07:55.680
Doesn't that suck?

00:07:55.680 --> 00:07:57.830
I mean it.

00:07:57.830 --> 00:07:59.300
Get away from him!

00:07:59.660 --> 00:08:03.210
No wonder you couldn't see her.

00:08:03.210 --> 00:08:05.180
Man-haters are such a troublesome bunch.

00:08:05.180 --> 00:08:06.320
Matabei!

00:08:06.320 --> 00:08:10.100
Leave for Yonezawa right now, and bring Maeda Keiji here!

00:08:10.860 --> 00:08:15.920
With your sense of smell, you should be able to find her regardless of her disguise.

00:08:15.920 --> 00:08:16.610
As you wish.

00:08:17.860 --> 00:08:20.570
Do we just wait for them, then?

00:08:20.570 --> 00:08:22.590
No, that'd be a waste of time.

00:08:22.590 --> 00:08:24.520
Let's just do what we can first.

00:08:24.520 --> 00:08:25.530
Yes.

00:08:26.660 --> 00:08:28.790
Do you really not remember?

00:08:28.790 --> 00:08:30.540
No one told me about that!

00:08:32.730 --> 00:08:34.060
<i>This</i> is what I think about it!

00:08:34.060 --> 00:08:34.890
U-Um...
<i>This</i> is what I think about it!

00:08:34.890 --> 00:08:35.420
U-Um...

00:08:37.040 --> 00:08:38.670
H-Hey!

00:08:41.420 --> 00:08:44.020
Don't touch me!

00:08:48.900 --> 00:08:50.870
What took you so long, Muneakira?!

00:08:51.820 --> 00:08:53.390
What happened to you, Onii-chan?

00:08:55.190 --> 00:08:59.590
It seems Kanetsugu wasn't informed of our plans.

00:09:00.660 --> 00:09:04.110
But wasn't she also present last night?

00:09:04.110 --> 00:09:08.160
My brain automatically ignores everything she says or does.

00:09:08.620 --> 00:09:11.710
Even if she <i>was</i> there, I wouldn't remember her!

00:09:13.540 --> 00:09:15.660
But more importantly, we should start training!

00:09:16.680 --> 00:09:21.430
According to this book, meditation is the best method of concentration!

00:09:21.430 --> 00:09:23.600
It should work well for training with qi as well.

00:09:23.600 --> 00:09:25.450
Meditation, huh?

00:09:25.450 --> 00:09:27.530
All right, let's give it a try.

00:09:43.370 --> 00:09:44.950
What the heck is this?!

00:09:50.770 --> 00:09:53.330
It's oil!

00:09:53.330 --> 00:09:55.700
Princess, look at that!

00:09:59.220 --> 00:10:03.900
She's harassing us like this just because we left her out?!

00:10:07.060 --> 00:10:14.180
Could this really be such an intensive task if spilling a little oil breaks your concentration?

00:10:15.440 --> 00:10:16.180
I see!

00:10:16.180 --> 00:10:18.490
Don't take her seriously!

00:10:24.280 --> 00:10:27.380
Geez, I can't believe she actually did that.

00:10:31.660 --> 00:10:35.750
It's too hot!

00:10:35.750 --> 00:10:40.350
Oh, weren't you training to use qi? Do you really have the time to laze around in the bath?

00:10:40.350 --> 00:10:43.840
And <i>whose</i> fault do you think it is that we need to take a bath?!

00:10:45.170 --> 00:10:48.630
Then you should enjoy this boiling hot bath.

00:10:48.630 --> 00:10:51.480
It might even serve as qi training.

00:10:51.480 --> 00:10:52.220
I see!

00:10:55.280 --> 00:10:56.850
Don't take her seriously!

00:10:57.180 --> 00:10:59.830
You should join her too.

00:10:59.830 --> 00:11:00.900
You fool!

00:11:04.580 --> 00:11:07.070
Damn you!

00:11:07.070 --> 00:11:10.780
You won't learn to use qi this way.

00:11:10.780 --> 00:11:15.100
She seriously wants to get in the way of our training!

00:11:15.100 --> 00:11:16.770
She <i>is</i> a drag, indeed.

00:11:16.770 --> 00:11:19.690
We need to think of countermeasures against her.

00:11:27.670 --> 00:11:34.430
According to this book, the best way to train mental fortitude is to sit under a waterfall.

00:11:34.430 --> 00:11:38.140
By training the spirit, one can find the secret of qi!

00:11:38.140 --> 00:11:41.230
Kanetsugu can't get in our way here, either.

00:11:42.060 --> 00:11:43.850
Dream on.

00:11:45.690 --> 00:11:48.290
Silence your heart completely.

00:11:48.290 --> 00:11:49.740
I know.

00:11:49.740 --> 00:11:52.740
Silence my heart.

00:11:54.570 --> 00:11:56.120
This sound...

00:12:05.210 --> 00:12:07.210
Dodge them!

00:12:10.970 --> 00:12:13.340
Kanetsugu must be behind this as well!

00:12:15.340 --> 00:12:19.350
You're training to use qi, so I checked to see if some wood could make you <i>qive</i> up!

00:12:19.350 --> 00:12:21.600
Damn your puns!

00:12:25.220 --> 00:12:27.310
Watch out, Juubei!

00:12:37.450 --> 00:12:40.910
Huh? You're done training already?

00:12:41.440 --> 00:12:43.660
Thank goodness you're okay.

00:12:44.250 --> 00:12:49.590
Maybe we'd've been fine if we'd stayed still just like Juubei?

00:12:53.050 --> 00:12:55.180
You panicked because of mere lumps of wood?

00:12:55.180 --> 00:12:58.680
How can you call that concentration?

00:13:02.020 --> 00:13:05.440
I'm going back ahead to the dojo!

00:13:06.520 --> 00:13:10.940
Oh no! She's plotting something again!

00:13:10.940 --> 00:13:13.150
No way! She'd do something to the dojo?

00:13:20.160 --> 00:13:23.450
It looks the same.

00:13:23.760 --> 00:13:26.000
We mustn't let our guard down.

00:13:26.000 --> 00:13:27.670
At times like this...

00:13:28.880 --> 00:13:30.820
Thanks for going in first!

00:13:31.870 --> 00:13:33.450
You got a problem with that?

00:13:33.450 --> 00:13:34.470
N-Not at all.

00:13:43.060 --> 00:13:45.600
How could you fall into such a trap?

00:13:45.600 --> 00:13:47.190
You're useless.

00:13:47.190 --> 00:13:49.060
I'm terribly sorry.

00:13:49.440 --> 00:13:50.860
Damn Kanetsugu.

00:13:50.860 --> 00:13:53.570
She wants to keep us out of the dojo.

00:13:54.030 --> 00:13:55.360
Kanetsugu!

00:13:55.360 --> 00:13:59.620
I'm sorry we decided to close the cafe without talking it through with you!

00:14:00.450 --> 00:14:03.080
But we're running out of time!

00:14:03.080 --> 00:14:05.920
Just don't get in the way of our training!

00:14:05.920 --> 00:14:10.630
If you want me to forgive you, come here and apologize on your knees!

00:14:10.630 --> 00:14:12.880
Enough of this nonsense!

00:14:12.880 --> 00:14:15.420
We'll throw you out if you don't stop this!

00:14:15.420 --> 00:14:16.510
Very well.

00:14:17.550 --> 00:14:19.760
It's my fault for not explaining properly.

00:14:19.760 --> 00:14:21.680
Wait, Muneakira!

00:14:21.680 --> 00:14:24.140
We have no idea what traps she set up!

00:14:24.660 --> 00:14:26.890
Yet I've got no choice but to go.

00:14:27.560 --> 00:14:28.770
Muneakira...

00:14:30.400 --> 00:14:31.980
Duck, Onii-chan!

00:14:32.980 --> 00:14:34.190
Muneakira!

00:14:34.190 --> 00:14:35.070
Are you okay?

00:14:36.940 --> 00:14:38.700
Onii-chan!

00:14:38.700 --> 00:14:40.240
Juubei, thank you.

00:14:41.490 --> 00:14:42.990
I'll go with you.

00:14:43.460 --> 00:14:45.080
All right, thanks.

00:14:50.920 --> 00:14:51.580
Stop.

00:14:56.900 --> 00:14:59.050
How did you know, Juubei?

00:15:00.300 --> 00:15:01.720
I just knew.

00:15:02.800 --> 00:15:04.300
That's just like you.

00:15:23.780 --> 00:15:24.990
Kanetsugu...

00:15:24.990 --> 00:15:27.540
I'm not amused at all.

00:15:27.920 --> 00:15:30.870
I do my best to help you with your training,

00:15:30.870 --> 00:15:33.540
but <i>she's</i> the only one who takes it seriously.

00:15:36.420 --> 00:15:37.920
What do you mean, Kanetsugu?!

00:15:38.360 --> 00:15:40.170
I told you!

00:15:40.170 --> 00:15:44.010
I tried helping you all with your qi training!

00:15:44.680 --> 00:15:49.310
If you did it properly,
you'd already know the basics,

00:15:49.310 --> 00:15:50.850
just like her.

00:15:51.770 --> 00:15:53.310
Wh-What are you talking about?

00:15:53.310 --> 00:15:55.860
I'm <i>talking</i> about...

00:15:55.860 --> 00:15:58.940
I gathered those for our training.

00:15:59.380 --> 00:16:05.150
If you think you can master qi just by reading published books,

00:16:05.150 --> 00:16:06.950
you're quite mistaken!

00:16:06.950 --> 00:16:08.870
Kanetsugu, you...

00:16:09.410 --> 00:16:10.750
What is it?

00:16:13.330 --> 00:16:15.500
Are you really Kanetsugu?

00:16:17.340 --> 00:16:18.690
Now that you mention it,

00:16:18.690 --> 00:16:20.330
Kanetsugu's never this bold.

00:16:20.330 --> 00:16:22.510
She's a wimp who becomes timid very easily.

00:16:22.510 --> 00:16:27.470
A weakling who can barely stand out.

00:16:28.180 --> 00:16:29.470
And now this?

00:16:30.140 --> 00:16:32.350
How can she act so almighty?

00:16:32.350 --> 00:16:33.390
Lady Yukimura!

00:16:33.390 --> 00:16:36.860
Matabei? Why aren't you in Yonezawa?

00:16:36.860 --> 00:16:40.900
I went there, but Maeda was no longer there.

00:16:40.900 --> 00:16:43.200
I ordered you to find her!

00:16:43.200 --> 00:16:47.240
Yes, and I followed her trail...

00:16:47.580 --> 00:16:48.280
to here.

00:16:48.280 --> 00:16:50.080
To the dojo?

00:16:51.500 --> 00:16:55.920
Maeda Keiji's a master of disguise, right?

00:16:56.420 --> 00:16:58.380
Then that means...

00:16:58.780 --> 00:17:01.090
Juubei. Muneakira.

00:17:01.670 --> 00:17:03.920
What, Gutsugutsu-san?

00:17:05.430 --> 00:17:08.050
Show them the result of your training.

00:17:27.780 --> 00:17:29.530
Unmatched on this Earth!

00:17:29.990 --> 00:17:31.410
Yagyuu Juubei!

00:17:32.950 --> 00:17:34.160
Juubei...

00:17:35.690 --> 00:17:36.730
This is...

00:17:37.280 --> 00:17:39.420
I can finally show my true form.

00:17:40.250 --> 00:17:42.250
Juubei became a Master Samurai?

00:17:42.710 --> 00:17:44.090
So you <i>must</i> be Mae—

00:17:44.090 --> 00:17:48.260
Whoa there. You mustn't blow someone's cover.

00:17:49.220 --> 00:17:51.760
The greatest dandy in the world!

00:17:52.140 --> 00:17:55.470
I am Maeda Keiji!

00:17:57.770 --> 00:17:59.600
You're Maeda Keiji?

00:17:59.600 --> 00:18:02.310
Wh-Why are you here?

00:18:02.730 --> 00:18:05.900
Simply put, to seek another woman's love.

00:18:06.360 --> 00:18:07.280
Love?

00:18:09.050 --> 00:18:12.630
I watched the M-1 Grand Prix the other day.

00:18:13.280 --> 00:18:14.910
And I thought...

00:18:15.370 --> 00:18:20.750
I'd come to the winning team's cafe and enjoy the treats of cute girls!

00:18:21.080 --> 00:18:25.510
I see. So the M-1's influence reached all the way to Yonezawa.

00:18:25.960 --> 00:18:27.300
But then!

00:18:27.800 --> 00:18:30.340
What do I see after coming all this way?

00:18:30.340 --> 00:18:33.550
You've closed the cafe and started qi training?!

00:18:33.550 --> 00:18:35.220
Give me a break!

00:18:35.220 --> 00:18:37.890
You came all this way! I'm really sorry!

00:18:38.560 --> 00:18:41.770
Not to mention the fact that you're doing it all wrong.

00:18:41.770 --> 00:18:44.310
It was upsetting just to watch.

00:18:44.310 --> 00:18:47.940
But you wanted to learn from me,

00:18:47.940 --> 00:18:49.900
so I gave you a little taste.

00:18:51.410 --> 00:18:54.030
She alone showed some progress.

00:18:54.030 --> 00:18:55.660
Yeah. Thanks.

00:18:56.030 --> 00:18:57.580
Thanks a lot!

00:18:58.910 --> 00:19:01.790
Do <i>not</i> touch me!

00:19:03.250 --> 00:19:04.110
She...

00:19:04.110 --> 00:19:05.800
...really hates men.

00:19:06.210 --> 00:19:08.090
By the way, where's Kanetsugu?

00:19:09.750 --> 00:19:12.130
Where's the real Kanetsugu?

00:19:13.790 --> 00:19:15.220
Crap. I forgot about her.

00:19:17.640 --> 00:19:22.230
Why do <i>I</i> have to go through this?!

00:19:22.480 --> 00:19:23.730
<b>Evening</b>

00:19:24.080 --> 00:19:25.900
I'm really sorry!

00:19:25.900 --> 00:19:28.570
Forgive me! We're childhood friends, after all!

00:19:28.570 --> 00:19:30.630
You two are childhood friends?

00:19:30.630 --> 00:19:34.360
Yep. I used to look after her.

00:19:34.360 --> 00:19:37.830
When exactly was that?

00:19:37.830 --> 00:19:39.620
Huh? You don't remember?

00:19:40.370 --> 00:19:42.620
Then you won't mind if I talk about it,

00:19:43.000 --> 00:19:44.330
Cursed Girl?

00:19:46.920 --> 00:19:51.210
Y-You don't have to go into specifics.

00:19:51.210 --> 00:19:55.010
I can pretty much imagine their relationship.

00:19:55.010 --> 00:19:55.760
Indeed.

00:19:57.890 --> 00:19:59.850
It's been quite a while.

00:20:00.640 --> 00:20:03.650
What are you talking about?
We've been together all along.

00:20:04.940 --> 00:20:08.650
Turning into a Master Samurai might change my appearance a little,

00:20:09.340 --> 00:20:12.690
but inside I'm still the same Yagyuu Juubei.

00:20:12.690 --> 00:20:17.490
Even if I return to my normal form, I probably won't lose my memories again.

00:20:17.490 --> 00:20:18.290
I see.

00:20:18.780 --> 00:20:21.290
Did that clear your worries, Onii-chan?

00:20:22.750 --> 00:20:25.420
Don't call him that in that form!

00:20:25.420 --> 00:20:26.790
It's just too weird!

00:20:27.290 --> 00:20:27.790
Could you keep calling me
Muneakira while in this form?

00:20:27.790 --> 00:20:32.130
That woman could help her get back her powers.

00:20:32.130 --> 00:20:33.920
I'm just joking.

00:20:34.510 --> 00:20:36.220
Hey, you, eye patch girl!

00:20:37.180 --> 00:20:39.930
At least come here and introduce yourself.

00:20:42.350 --> 00:20:43.940
Who are you kidding?

00:20:44.480 --> 00:20:45.850
Gisen...

00:20:45.850 --> 00:20:49.930
But shouldn't you return to your normal form?

00:20:49.930 --> 00:20:53.110
She's right. There aren't any enemies around.

00:20:53.690 --> 00:20:55.700
Yeah, that'd be a good idea.

00:20:55.700 --> 00:20:59.030
You can't control qi perfectly yet,

00:20:59.030 --> 00:21:02.120
so if you stay like that you'll just keep emitting it,

00:21:02.120 --> 00:21:04.540
and you'll end up in another ugly mess.

00:21:04.540 --> 00:21:06.040
All right. I understand.

00:21:10.170 --> 00:21:12.840
What are you doing? Can't you change back?

00:21:12.840 --> 00:21:16.720
I'm trying to.

00:21:18.800 --> 00:21:21.600
Wait, you can't?

00:21:26.470 --> 00:21:28.150
Apparently not.

00:21:29.770 --> 00:21:32.520
Now we're in a pickle.

00:21:35.610 --> 00:21:36.740
Episode Six

00:23:10.870 --> 00:23:12.960
Allow me to introduce myself.

00:23:12.960 --> 00:23:15.630
My name is Maeda Keiji!

00:23:15.630 --> 00:23:18.800
I'm a student of the Yonezawa branch of the Buou Academy.

00:23:18.800 --> 00:23:22.680
Sometimes people come to me to learn about qi, but let me make this clear.

00:23:22.680 --> 00:23:24.930
I will <i>never</i> teach a man!

00:23:24.930 --> 00:23:26.870
I pretend to be away at such times,

00:23:26.870 --> 00:23:29.110
though I <i>am</i> actually traveling quite a lot.

00:23:29.110 --> 00:23:32.980
Hm? Why do I call Kanetsugu "Cursed Girl"?

00:23:32.980 --> 00:23:34.150
Well...

00:23:34.150 --> 00:23:36.170
Next time: Unreleasable!

00:23:36.170 --> 00:23:38.490
You are duty-bound to watch it!

00:23:38.490 --> 00:23:39.990
That's how it rolls. Got it?
